# Re-include the per-machine agent state .gitignore hides, so Cursor indexes it.
# .env stays ignored: it holds secrets. Overrides .gitignore and the default
# ignores. See https://cursor.com/docs/reference/ignore-file
#
# .claude/plans/ needs the directory un-ignored before its contents: gitignore
# matching never descends into an excluded directory.
!.claude/settings.local.json
!.claude/plans/
!.claude/plans/**
!AGENTS.override.md
!CLAUDE.local.md
